  first | exact @GlobalTheory.OddThetaNorm.odd_theta_norm_sigma_star | exact GlobalTheory.OddThetaNorm.odd_theta_norm_sigma_star | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.OddThetaNorm.odd_theta_norm_sigma_star <;> assumption)
